@host = http://localhost:5135

### Create a book
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dune", "author": "Frank Herbert" }

### List all books
GET {{host}}/books

### Loan a book
PATCH {{host}}/books/80916d42-8b64-4018-bebe-6be4730f44a3/loan

### Return a book
PATCH {{host}}/books/80916d42-8b64-4018-bebe-6be4730f44a3/return

### Delete a book
DELETE {{host}}/books/80916d42-8b64-4018-bebe-6be4730f44a3